      "background_kind": "curated",
      "heading": "1 · Stage the tool",
      "sentence": "Use generative tools for early variation; keep problem framing and final judgment human.",
      "image_brief": "Stage the tool: machines widen search; people still set the problem.",
      "notes": "- Early variation is not the same as outsourcing the brief.\n- Name the stage before you open a tool.\n- Final form and responsibility stay with the designer.\nSource: course wording from unit enrichment (Park / studio pedagogy still pending page-level citation resolve).\nAsk: Where in your last brief did a tool belong — and where did it not?",
      "claims": [],
