      "image_brief": "Assess judgment: stacks of listings show collaboration and checking, not only a finished surface.",
      "notes": "- Surfaces are easy to compare; judgment is harder and more important.\n- Portfolio traces make collaboration visible.\n- Aligns with course critical layer on GenAI authorship (C3).\nSource: course wording; Park IASDR 2025 still candidate — do not cite until page-level citation resolve.\nAsk: What evidence would prove you directed the tool?",
